              "30",
              "36",
              "35",
              "49"
            ],
            "correctIndex": 1,
            "explanation": "These are squares: 2², 3², 4², 5², so next is 6² = 36."
          },
          {
            "id": "logical-series-cp2",
            "type": "multipleChoice",
            "prompt": "What comes next?",
            "snippet": "3, 6, 12, 24, ?",
            "options": [
              "48",
              "36",
              "30",
              "42"
            ],
            "correctIndex": 0,
            "explanation": "Each term doubles, so 24 × 2 = 48."
          },
          {
            "id": "logical-series-cp3",
            "type": "multipleChoice",
            "prompt": "What comes next?",
